# The original's selector lacks Builder, so it doubled the sight of every ground unit; the curated version doubles builders' only
right only field units/*.fbi [unitinfo] sightdistance: *

# The original's leash field is misspelt, so it changed no leash; the curated version doubles maneuverleashlength
left only field units/*.fbi [unitinfo] maneuverleashlength: *
